rse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja467:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:9.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:9.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja467:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja467:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja467:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja467:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja467:13.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja467:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja467:0.2": "Dvādasakanipāta ", "ja467:0.3": "Cūḷakuṇālavagga ", "ja467:0.4": "4. Kāmajātaka ", "ja467:1.1": "“Kāmaṁ kāmayamānassa, ", "ja467:1.2": "tassa ce taṁ samijjhati; ", "ja467:1.3": "Addhā pītimano hoti, ", "ja467:1.4": "laddhā macco yadicchati. ", "ja467:2.1": "Kāmaṁ kāmayamānassa, ", "ja467:2.2": "tassa ce taṁ samijjhati; ", "ja467:2.3": "Tato naṁ aparaṁ kāme, ", "ja467:2.4": "ghamme taṇhaṁva vindati. ", "ja467:3.1": "Gavaṁva siṅgino siṅgaṁ, ", "ja467:3.2": "vaḍḍhamānassa vaḍḍhati; ", "ja467:3.3": "Evaṁ mandassa posassa, ", "ja467:3.4": "bālassa avijānato; ", "ja467:3.5": "Bhiyyo taṇhā pipāsā ca, ", "ja467:3.6": "vaḍḍhamānassa vaḍḍhati. ", "ja467:4.1": "Pathabyā sāliyavakaṁ, ", "ja467:4.2": "gavāssaṁ dāsaporisaṁ; ", "ja467:4.3": "Datvā ca nālamekassa, ", "ja467:4.4": "iti vidvā samaṁ care. ", "ja467:5.1": "Rājā pasayha pathaviṁ vijitvā, ", "ja467:5.2": "Sasāgarantaṁ mahimāvasanto; ", "ja467:5.3": "Oraṁ samuddassa atittarūpo, ", "ja467:5.4": "Pāraṁ samuddassapi patthayetha. ", "ja467:6.1": "Yāva anussaraṁ kāme, ", "ja467:6.2": "Manasā titti nājjhagā; ", "ja467:6.3": "Tato nivattā paṭikkamma disvā, ", "ja467:6.4": "Te ve sutittā ye paññāya tittā. ", "ja467:7.1": "Paññāya tittinaṁ seṭṭhaṁ, ", "ja467:7.2": "na so kāmehi tappati; ", "ja467:7.3": "Paññāya tittaṁ purisaṁ, ", "ja467:7.4": "taṇhā na kurute vasaṁ. ", "ja467:8.1": "Apacinetheva kāmānaṁ, ", "ja467:8.2": "appicchassa alolupo; ", "ja467:8.3": "Samuddamatto puriso, ", "ja467:8.4": "na so kāmehi tappati. ", "ja467:9.1": "Rathakārova cammassa, ", "ja467:9.2": "parikantaṁ upāhanaṁ; ", "ja467:9.3": "Yaṁ yaṁ cajati kāmānaṁ, ", "ja467:9.4": "taṁ taṁ sampajjate sukhaṁ; ", "ja467:9.5": "Sabbañce sukhamiccheyya, ", "ja467:9.6": "sabbe kāme pariccaje”. ", "ja467:10.1": "“Aṭṭha te bhāsitā gāthā, ", "ja467:10.2": "sabbā honti sahassiyo; ", "ja467:10.3": "Paṭigaṇha mahābrahme, ", "ja467:10.4": "sādhetaṁ tava bhāsitaṁ”. ", "ja467:11.1": "“Na me attho sahassehi, ", "ja467:11.2": "satehi nahutehi vā; ", "ja467:11.3": "Pacchimaṁ bhāsato gāthaṁ, ", "ja467:11.4": "kāme me na rato mano”. ", "ja467:12.1": "“Bhadrako vatāyaṁ māṇavako, ", "ja467:12.2": "Sabbalokavidū muni; ", "ja467:12.3": "Yo imaṁ taṇhaṁ dukkhajananiṁ, ", "ja467:12.4": "Parijānāti paṇḍito”ti. ", "ja467:13.1": "Kāmajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja467:0.1": "", "ja467:0.2": "", "ja467:0.3": "", "ja467:0.4": "", "ja467:1.1": "", "ja467:1.2": "", "ja467:1.3": "", "ja467:1.4": "", "ja467:2.1": "", "ja467:2.2": "", "ja467:2.3": "", "ja467:2.4": "", "ja467:3.1": "", "ja467:3.2": "", "ja467:3.3": "", "ja467:3.4": "", "ja467:3.5": "", "ja467:3.6": "", "ja467:4.1": "", "ja467:4.2": "gavāssaṁ → gavassaṁ (mr) ", "ja467:4.3": "Datvā ca → datvāpi (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); datvā vā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja467:4.4": "vidvā → viddhā (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja467:5.1": "", "ja467:5.2": "", "ja467:5.3": "atittarūpo → atittirūpo (mr) ", "ja467:5.4": "", "ja467:6.1": "", "ja467:6.2": "", "ja467:6.3": "", "ja467:6.4": "sutittā → tittā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja467:7.1": "tittinaṁ → tittīnaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja467:7.2": "", "ja467:7.3": "", "ja467:7.4": "", "ja467:8.1": "kāmānaṁ → kāmāni (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja467:8.2": "", "ja467:8.3": "", "ja467:8.4": "", "ja467:9.1": "", "ja467:9.2": "", "ja467:9.3": "cajati → jahati (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja467:9.4": "", "ja467:9.5": "", "ja467:9.6": "", "ja467:10.1": "", "ja467:10.2": "sahassiyo → sahassiyā (?) ", "ja467:10.3": "", "ja467:10.4": "", "ja467:11.1": "", "ja467:11.2": "", "ja467:11.3": "", "ja467:11.4": "", "ja467:12.1": "Bhadrako → bhaddo (bj); bhaddako (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja467:12.2": "", "ja467:12.3": "imaṁ taṇhaṁ → yo taṇhaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja467:12.4": "", "ja467:13.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja467:0.1": "", "ja467:0.2": "", "ja467:0.3": "", "ja467:0.4": "", "ja467:1.1": "csp1ed22.246, csp2ed22.246, ms22J_2278, msdiv37, pts-vp-pli4.172", "ja467:1.2": "", "ja467:1.3": "", "ja467:1.4": "", "ja467:2.1": "ms22J_2279, msdiv38", "ja467:2.2": "", "ja467:2.3": "", "ja467:2.4": "", "ja467:3.1": "ms22J_2280, msdiv39", "ja467:3.2": "", "ja467:3.3": "", "ja467:3.4": "", "ja467:3.5": "", "ja467:3.6": "", "ja467:4.1": "ms22J_2281, msdiv40", "ja467:4.2": "", "ja467:4.3": "", "ja467:4.4": "", "ja467:5.1": "ms22J_2282, msdiv41, sya27.329", "ja467:5.2": "", "ja467:5.3": "", "ja467:5.4": "", "ja467:6.1": "dr27.327, ms22J_2283, msdiv42", "ja467:6.2": "", "ja467:6.3": "", "ja467:6.4": "", "ja467:7.1": "bj30.422, ms22J_2284, msdiv43", "ja467:7.2": "", "ja467:7.3": "", "ja467:7.4": "", "ja467:8.1": "ms22J_2285, msdiv44", "ja467:8.2": "", "ja467:8.3": "", "ja467:8.4": "", "ja467:9.1": "ms22J_2286, msdiv45, ndp22.239, pts-vp-pli4.173", "ja467:9.2": "", "ja467:9.3": "", "ja467:9.4": "", "ja467:9.5": "", "ja467:9.6": "", "ja467:10.1": "csp1ed22.247, csp2ed22.247, ms22J_2287, msdiv46, pts-vp-pli4.175", "ja467:10.2": "", "ja467:10.3": "", "ja467:10.4": "", "ja4